‪Practice by yourself. No, by yourself.

694
00:32:58,935 --> 00:33:01,562
‪You, Yurisa! Practice by yourself!

695
00:33:05,525 --> 00:33:09,070
‪She should be practicing
‪like there's no tomorrow, not sleeping.

696
00:33:09,153 --> 00:33:11,072
‪I can't believe her.

697
00:33:12,865 --> 00:33:13,700
‪Here.

698
00:33:20,206 --> 00:33:22,000
‪No, focus on the board.

699
00:33:22,083 --> 00:33:23,501
‪You can't place it there.

700
00:33:23,584 --> 00:33:25,712
‪I have a strategy.

701
00:33:25,795 --> 00:33:27,296
‪Don't trust your strategy!

702
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:29,132
‪He's like a coach.

703
00:33:29,215 --> 00:33:30,758
‪This isn't exactly the best move.

704
00:33:30,842 --> 00:33:31,926
‪No!

705
00:33:32,885 --> 00:33:33,970
‪Jeez, he scared me.

706
00:33:34,053 --> 00:33:35,304
‪No!

707
00:33:35,388 --> 00:33:37,265
‪You shouldn't move that one first!

708
00:33:37,932 --> 00:33:39,142
‪No!

709
00:33:39,892 --> 00:33:41,019
‪No!

710
00:33:41,561 --> 00:33:42,687
‪Take that back.

711
00:33:42,770 --> 00:33:44,063
‪I can't see through all this spit.

712
00:33:45,148 --> 00:33:46,816
‪Dong-min, I got it now.

713
00:33:46,899 --> 00:33:48,359
‪-You got it?
‪-Yeah.

714
00:33:50,528 --> 00:33:51,571
‪My goodness, Dong-min.

715
00:33:52,238 --> 00:33:56,242
<i>‪The prison match will begin in 30 minutes.</i>

716
00:33:56,826 --> 00:33:59,746
<i>‪Now, let me introduce</i>
<i>‪the fourth prison match.</i>

717
00:34:00,246 --> 00:34:01,164
‪What is it?

718
00:34:01,247 --> 00:34:02,582
<i>‪Today's prison match is</i>

719
00:34:03,124 --> 00:34:04,625
<i>‪Wall Go II.</i>

720
00:34:08,713 --> 00:34:09,797
<i>‪In Wall Go II,</i>

721
00:34:09,881 --> 00:34:11,883
<i>‪-players have to build walls on the board</i>
‪-Unreal.

722
00:34:11,966 --> 00:34:15,261
<i>‪to make their territories</i>
<i>‪as large as possible.</i>

723
00:34:15,344 --> 00:34:21,309
<i>‪Each player will be given</i>
<i>‪one square counter and one round counter.</i>

724
00:34:21,809 --> 00:34:23,269
<i>‪The square counter</i>

725
00:34:23,352 --> 00:34:25,021
<i>‪can be moved one or two spaces</i>

726
00:34:25,104 --> 00:34:27,732
<i>‪in a straight line</i>
<i>‪up, down, left, or right.</i>

727
00:34:28,483 --> 00:34:29,484
<i>‪The round counter</i>

728
00:34:29,567 --> 00:34:32,236
<i>‪can be moved one space</i>
<i>‪up, down, left, or right,</i>

729
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:35,615
<i>‪and then change direction</i>
<i>‪to the left or right</i>

730
00:34:35,698 --> 00:34:37,658
<i>‪and move it one additional space.</i>

731
00:34:38,367 --> 00:34:40,411
<i>‪Beginning with the first player,</i>

732
00:34:40,495 --> 00:34:43,581
<i>‪each player will take turns</i>
<i>‪placing one of their counters</i>

733
00:34:43,664 --> 00:34:46,042
<i>‪on a square of their choice.</i>

734
00:34:46,751 --> 00:34:50,755
<i>‪The order will be reversed</i>
<i>‪when placing the second counter.</i>

735
00:34:51,339 --> 00:34:53,341
<i>‪When the game starts,</i>

736
00:34:53,424 --> 00:34:56,385
<i>‪each player in turn</i>
<i>‪will move one of their counters.</i>

737
00:34:58,179 --> 00:35:02,517
<i>‪The counters cannot be moved to a space</i>
<i>‪that is already occupied.</i>

738
00:35:03,810 --> 00:35:05,353
<i>‪Once the counter reaches its destination,</i>

739
00:35:05,436 --> 00:35:08,272
<i>‪players must build a wall</i>
<i>‪on one of the sides of the squares</i>

740
00:35:08,356 --> 00:35:10,066
<i>‪occupied by their counter.</i>

741
00:35:10,733 --> 00:35:14,278
<i>‪A wall cannot be built on a side</i>
<i>‪where a wall has already been built.</i>

742
00:35:15,863 --> 00:35:19,408
<i>‪Each player will have 90 seconds</i>
<i>‪to complete their turn,</i>

743
00:35:19,492 --> 00:35:22,620
<i>‪and if they exceed their time,</i>
<i>‪a wall will be placed at random.</i>

744
00:35:23,621 --> 00:35:28,334
<i>‪When moving a counter,</i>
<i>‪it may not pass through a wall</i>

745
00:35:28,417 --> 00:35:30,962
<i>‪that is blocking its way.</i>

746
00:35:32,046 --> 00:35:36,384
<i>‪However, each player</i>
<i>‪will be given one wall breaker</i>

747
00:35:36,467 --> 00:35:38,678
<i>‪to knock down a wall</i>
<i>‪on one of their turns.</i>

748
00:35:39,804 --> 00:35:42,598
<i>‪During this move,</i>
<i>‪a player may only knock down a wall</i>

749
00:35:42,682 --> 00:35:44,392
<i>‪that is blocking their path.</i>

750
00:35:44,475 --> 00:35:47,770
<i>‪The game will continue in this manner</i>

751
00:35:47,854 --> 00:35:52,483
<i>‪until each player's counters are walled</i>
<i>‪into their own separate territory,</i>

752
00:35:53,151 --> 00:35:55,862
<i>‪at which point the game will conclude.</i>

753
00:35:55,945 --> 00:35:59,657
<i>‪Players should note</i>
<i>‪that the game will conclude</i>

754
00:35:59,740 --> 00:36:03,369
<i>‪even if not all players have taken</i>
<i>‪the chance to play their wall breaker.</i>

755
00:36:03,452 --> 00:36:05,371
<i>‪The number of squares</i>
<i>‪enclosed in each player's territory</i>

756
00:36:05,454 --> 00:36:06,998
<i>‪will be added together,</i>

757
00:36:07,081 --> 00:36:09,584
<i>‪and rankings will be determined</i>

758
00:36:09,667 --> 00:36:11,294
<i>‪according to the size</i>
<i>‪of their territories,</i>

759
00:36:11,377 --> 00:36:13,921
<i>‪with the first-place player</i>
<i>‪securing their survival.</i>

760
00:36:14,005 --> 00:36:17,049
<i>‪If multiple players are tied</i>
<i>‪for the same number of squares,</i>

761
00:36:17,133 --> 00:36:19,135
<i>‪their rankings will be determined</i>

762
00:36:19,218 --> 00:36:23,055
<i>‪by comparing the areas</i>
<i>‪of their biggest territories.</i>

763
00:36:24,015 --> 00:36:26,767
<i>‪The two remaining players</i>

764
00:36:26,851 --> 00:36:29,145
<i>‪will engage in another game of Wall Go II.</i>

765
00:36:29,979 --> 00:36:31,189
‪That'll be the real game.

766
00:36:31,731 --> 00:36:32,857
<i>‪The two players</i>

767
00:36:32,940 --> 00:36:35,276
<i>‪will each be given two square counters</i>
<i>‪and two round counters,</i>

768
00:36:35,359 --> 00:36:37,904
<i>‪for a total of four counters.</i>

769
00:36:38,571 --> 00:36:40,656
<i>‪The starting positions</i>
<i>‪of the two round counters</i>

770
00:36:40,740 --> 00:36:42,116
<i>‪will be pre-assigned,</i>

771
00:36:42,909 --> 00:36:46,913
<i>‪and players may only freely place</i>
<i>‪the two square counters.</i>

772
00:36:48,289 --> 00:36:52,001
<i>‪Wall breakers cannot be used in this game.</i>

773
00:36:53,628 --> 00:36:54,879
<i>‪When the game ends,</i>

774
00:36:54,962 --> 00:36:59,050
<i>‪the player with the larger territory</i>
<i>‪will secure their survival,</i>

775
00:36:59,133 --> 00:37:03,137
<i>‪and the last remaining player</i>
<i>‪will be eliminated from </i>‪The Devil's Plan.

776
00:37:03,721 --> 00:37:06,474
<i>‪Furthermore, the two players who survive</i>

777
00:37:06,557 --> 00:37:08,267
<i>‪will be rewarded with a Piece each.</i>

778
00:37:09,185 --> 00:37:12,521
<i>‪The game will begin in 30 minutes.</i>

779
00:37:13,105 --> 00:37:13,981
‪Let's just start now.

780
00:37:15,650 --> 00:37:16,776
‪Can't we just do it here?

781
00:37:16,859 --> 00:37:18,444
