00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:01,654
‪How are they different?

807
00:38:01,737 --> 00:38:03,155
‪Oh, you get two counters.

808
00:38:03,239 --> 00:38:04,073
‪As long as it's not blocked,

809
00:38:04,156 --> 00:38:06,659
‪the round counter
‪can go to one of these eight squares.

810
00:38:06,742 --> 00:38:09,370
‪The square counter can only go straight,
‪up to two squares.

811
00:38:09,453 --> 00:38:12,123
‪The square counter
‪acts like a chariot in Janggi.

812
00:38:12,206 --> 00:38:16,669
<i>‪It can cover a lot of ground</i>
