‪-Bring it back? You can't.
‪-No, you can't do that.

818
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:34,520
‪You can only go in one direction
‪with this one.

819
00:38:34,603 --> 00:38:36,731
‪And with this, you move it, and then
‪you can go left or right from there.

820
