837
00:39:19,607 --> 00:39:21,484
‪-Then I win!
‪-You're a pro.

838
00:39:21,567 --> 00:39:23,361
‪-That's amazing.
‪-I win.

839
00:39:23,444 --> 00:39:26,238
‪I lost to XITSUH every time
‪up in the living area,

840
00:39:26,322 --> 00:39:28,574
<i>‪but then I won every game down in prison.</i>

841
00:39:28,657 --> 00:39:29,784
‪How did this happen?

842
00:39:29,867 --> 00:39:32,286
‪I've been deceiving you this whole time,
‪all for today.

843
00:39:32,370 --> 00:39:33,871
‪Let's go again.

844
00:39:33,954 --> 00:39:35,414
‪-Do you forfeit?
‪-I do.

845
00:39:35,498 --> 00:39:36,999
‪Come back here.

846
00:39:37,666 --> 00:39:39,168
‪I've been hiding my skills
‪this whole time.

847
00:39:39,251 --> 00:39:41,337
‪-Hey, I…
‪-Did you think I'd be bad at this?

848
00:39:41,420 --> 00:39:42,963
‪I won't go easy on you this time.

849
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:46,133
‪I lost.

850
00:39:46,217 --> 00:39:47,385
‪GG.

851
00:39:47,468 --> 00:39:48,677
‪-A total wipeout.
‪-Good job.

852
00:39:48,761 --> 00:39:50,179
‪-I told you I figured it out.
‪-You won?

853
00:39:50,262 --> 00:39:51,180
‪-I cracked it.
‪-Jesus.

854
00:39:51,263 --> 00:39:53,140
‪-Two wins against XITSUH.
‪-I'm shocked.

855
00:39:53,224 --> 00:39:55,893
<i>‪Neither of them was amazing at it.</i>

856
00:39:55,976 --> 00:39:57,686
‪So I figured whoever messes up first
‪will lose.

857
