<i>‪Yurisa also asked if we should team up.</i>

859
00:40:08,656 --> 00:40:11,909
<i>‪I told her that I'd be down if she were.</i>

860
00:40:11,992 --> 00:40:16,664
‪I think she got a confidence boost
‪after winning down here.

861
00:40:16,747 --> 00:40:21,877
‪She hasn't mentioned teaming up again,
‪so I guess it's every man for himself.

862
00:40:23,003 --> 00:40:24,839
‪-Let's go.
‪-Let's have a fun game.

863
00:40:24,922 --> 00:40:25,965
‪-Good luck!
‪-You too.

864
00:40:26,048 --> 00:40:29,301
<i>‪-The prison match will begin shortly.</i>
‪-Good luck!

865
00:40:29,385 --> 00:40:31,262
<i>‪All players in the prison,</i>

866
00:40:31,345 --> 00:40:35,599
<i>‪please make your way to the death room</i>
