00:40:36,767 --> 00:40:37,601
‪Let's do this.

868
00:40:46,610 --> 00:40:47,903
‪It's nice and big.

869
00:40:49,864 --> 00:40:54,034
<i>‪We will begin the fourth prison match,</i>
<i>‪Wall Go II.</i>

870
00:40:54,535 --> 00:40:58,914
