875
00:41:09,633 --> 00:41:11,594
‪XITSUH, you are number three
‪with red counters.

876
00:41:11,677 --> 00:41:12,803
‪Please return them.

877
00:41:12,887 --> 00:41:15,473
‪Great. I'm staying in the same spot.
