00:41:19,310 --> 00:41:21,353
‪-Let's.
‪-Let's do this.

880
00:41:21,437 --> 00:41:22,313
‪All right.

881
00:41:23,189 --> 00:41:24,815
‪You will now place your counters.

882
00:41:25,316 --> 00:41:27,443
‪Yurisa, please place your counter.

883
00:41:27,526 --> 00:41:28,611
‪Right, I'm first.

884
00:41:30,070 --> 00:41:30,946
‪Standard play.

885
00:41:31,489 --> 00:41:33,407
‪John Park, please place your counter.

886
00:41:35,534 --> 00:41:36,660
‪With a counter there,

887
00:41:36,744 --> 00:41:39,622
‪-you start with a nine-square zone.
‪-Right.

888
00:41:39,705 --> 00:41:41,373
‪So you'd have to start from there.

889
00:41:41,457 --> 00:41:43,334
‪If you go diagonal, it's 16 squares.

890
00:41:43,417 --> 00:41:46,337
‪-But it's hard to control all that area.
‪-Oh, I see.

891
00:41:46,420 --> 00:41:48,380
‪So is it better to start from the edges
‪and work your way in?

892
00:41:48,464 --> 00:41:51,091
‪So if you go diagonal from Yurisa's spot,

893
00:41:51,175 --> 00:41:53,260
‪you can build a nine-square zone
‪and claim…

894
00:41:53,344 --> 00:41:54,178
‪Oh no.

895
00:41:54,762 --> 00:41:57,014
‪XITSUH, please place your second counter.

896
00:41:59,433 --> 00:42:02,102
<i>‪Honestly, I placed mine</i>
<i>‪a bit conservatively.</i>

897
00:42:02,186 --> 00:42:05,439
‪I signaled them that I'd be content
‪with a territory on my side,

898
00:42:05,523 --> 00:42:08,776
‪but John placed his rather aggressively.

899
00:42:08,859 --> 00:42:11,111
‪John Park, please place your counter.

900
00:42:12,404 --> 00:42:15,783
‪-Hey now, why are you coming here?
‪-Yurisa, please place your counter.

901
00:42:16,492 --> 00:42:17,618
‪What a mess.

902
00:42:17,701 --> 00:42:20,663
‪If they set up right next to you,
‪they're declaring war.

903
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:22,581
‪All counters have been placed.

904
00:42:22,665 --> 00:42:23,958
‪We will now begin Wall Go II.

905
00:42:24,041 --> 00:42:26,335
‪Yurisa, you have 90 seconds

906
00:42:26,418 --> 00:42:28,754
‪to move your counter and place a wall.

907
00:42:38,597 --> 00:42:39,932
‪Next, John Park.

908
00:42:49,191 --> 00:42:50,568
‪Next, XITSUH.

909
00:42:59,493 --> 00:43:01,161
‪John's in danger right now.

910
00:43:01,245 --> 00:43:04,582
‪The blue counter could box him in.

911
00:43:04,665 --> 00:43:07,293
‪He needs to free that square counter.

912
00:43:07,876 --> 00:43:09,169
‪Next, Yurisa.

913
00:43:24,602 --> 00:43:25,519
‪John Park.

914
00:43:34,236 --> 00:43:35,321
‪XITSUH.

915
00:43:40,826 --> 00:43:41,702
‪Yurisa.

916
00:43:49,960 --> 00:43:51,045
‪Next, John Park.

917
00:43:51,545 --> 00:43:56,050
