<i>‪that he wouldn't attack me.</i>

923
00:44:11,982 --> 00:44:13,192
‪One minute remaining.

924
00:44:18,364 --> 00:44:19,907
‪Next, XITSUH.

925
00:44:33,253 --> 00:44:34,254
‪Yurisa.

926
00:44:40,594 --> 00:44:42,429
‪Damn, you're placing it there?

927
00:44:42,513 --> 00:44:43,639
‪Are you trying to get a free ride?

928
00:44:50,854 --> 00:44:53,232
‪I wondered
‪if they were teaming up against me.

929
00:44:53,315 --> 00:44:54,441
‪Next, John Park.

930
00:45:04,701 --> 00:45:05,744
‪XITSUH.

931
00:45:22,803 --> 00:45:23,846
‪Yurisa.

932
00:45:28,892 --> 00:45:31,061
‪That blue counter's dead now.

933
