‪Out of 49 squares.

939
00:45:55,627 --> 00:45:57,629
‪He'll win at this rate.

940
00:45:57,713 --> 00:45:58,881
‪XITSUH.

941
00:46:01,758 --> 00:46:05,929
‪As I played, I came to realize
‪that in this three-player setup,

942
00:46:06,013 --> 00:46:10,976
