943
00:46:16,231 --> 00:46:18,484
‪XITSUH's territory grew too.

944
00:46:18,567 --> 00:46:19,902
‪Right, just block there.

945
00:46:23,197 --> 00:46:24,406
‪Yurisa.

946
00:46:39,588 --> 00:46:40,839
‪Why isn't it going in?

947
00:46:42,132 --> 00:46:43,217
‪Next, John Park.

948
00:47:00,067 --> 00:47:01,527
‪Next, XITSUH.

949
00:47:01,610 --> 00:47:03,403
‪Feels like we're headed for ruin.

950
00:47:03,487 --> 00:47:08,116
‪Yurisa kept making moves that seemed like
‪she was asking to be boxed in.

951
00:47:08,200 --> 00:47:11,662
